# Enterprise Universal 360° Workspace Framework (CO-360-001)

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Frozen architecture standard · Framework wave  
Sprint foundation: **CO-360-001**

## Constitutional principle

| Layer | Role |
|-------|------|
| **Registry** | Identity & Master Data — Enterprise SSOT |
| **Workspace** | Daily Operations — operational interface only |

No operational activity shall be performed directly inside a Registry.  
Registries remain administrative. Workspaces remain operational.

## Common framework

Every 360 Workspace inherits:

Executive Summary · Timeline · Documents · Tasks · Notes · Communications · Activities · AI Insights · Audit History · Attachments

Plus entity-specific sections from the module catalog.

## Document & task SSOT

- Documents → Enterprise Document Registry (projection only; never duplicate)
- Tasks → Enterprise Task Engine (`EntityTasksPanel` / `listTasksForEntity`)
- Do **not** invent parallel 360 document/task stores

## Existing entity desks

Customer 360 modal, Lender Workspace, Wealth Partner Workspace remain active desks.  
This framework is the **shared architecture**; adapters adopt the shell/catalog over time.  
Do not cut over primary nav in this wave without Product Architecture approval.

