## Entity modules

Customer · Lender · Wealth Partner · Vendor · Employee · Contact (identity + role deep-links)

## Forbidden

- Operational CRUD inside Registry screens as the primary path  
- Second document repository under 360  
- Parallel task engine for 360  
- Database migrations for framework-only waves without Architecture approval  
